flowchart TB
    A["Filtered Evidences<br/>(with relevance scores)"] --> B["Group by Claim<br/>cluster similar answers"]
    B --> C["Compare Supporting Evidence<br/>check agreement / conflict"]
    C --> D{"Consistent<br/>Evidence?"}
    D -- Yes --> E["Aggregate Evidence<br/>merge and select best<br/>supporting sources"]
    D -- No --> F["Mark as Conflicting<br/>keep multiple perspectives<br/>for debate"]
    E --> G["Aggregated Evidence Set<br/>(with consistency / conflict labels)"]
    F --> G
